 "content": "[{\"id\": \"bf75894648\", \"type\": \"header\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"<span class='h4'><b>Management</b></span>\", \"col\": 12}}, {\"id\": \"5accc7778f\", \"type\": \"header\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"<span class='h4'><b>Shortcuts</b></span>\", \"col\": 12}}, {\"id\": \"518d71d308\", \"type\": \"shortcut\", \"data\": {\"shortcut_name\": \"Management Dashboard\", \"col\": 3}}, {\"id\": \"882f3c65e6\", \"type\": \"shortcut\", \"data\": {\"shortcut_name\": \"Sales Analytics\", \"col\": 3}}, {\"id\": \"1e04a8c218\", \"type\": \"shortcut\", \"data\": {\"shortcut_name\": \"Purchase Analytics\", \"col\": 3}}, {\"id\": \"5e7af2702a\", \"type\": \"shortcut\", \"data\": {\"shortcut_name\": \"Daily Production\", \"col\": 3}}, {\"id\": \"911eeb55db\", \"type\": \"shortcut\", \"data\": {\"shortcut_name\": \"Dealer Network\", \"col\": 3}}, {\"id\": \"b08b84b385\", \"type\": \"shortcut\", \"data\": {\"shortcut_name\": \"People & Payroll\", \"col\": 3}}, {\"id\": \"842cd2697b\", \"type\": \"spacer\", \"data\": {\"col\": 12}}, {\"id\": \"dec82b2dfe\", \"type\": \"header\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"<span class='h4'><b>Reports & Masters</b></span>\", \"col\": 12}}, {\"id\": \"9afe616638\", \"type\": \"card\", \"data\": {\"card_name\": \"Sales\", \"col\": 4}}, {\"id\": \"1f07c32885\", \"type\": \"card\", \"data\": {\"card_name\": \"Purchase\", \"col\": 4}}, {\"id\": \"0b310fdf24\", \"type\": \"card\", \"data\": {\"card_name\": \"Plant\", \"col\": 4}}, {\"id\": \"9c29129b66\", \"type\": \"card\", \"data\": {\"card_name\": \"People\", \"col\": 4}}, {\"id\": \"44dc051d29\", \"type\": \"card\", \"data\": {\"card_name\": \"Money\", \"col\": 4}}, {\"id\": \"9be7d5e6a2\", \"type\": \"spacer\", \"data\": {\"col\": 12}}, {\"id\": \"08b2175e96\", \"type\": \"header\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"<span class='h4'><b>How to use this screen</b></span>\", \"col\": 12}}, {\"id\": \"06177482bb\", \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"data\": {\"text\": \"<div style='border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--fg-color)'><p style='margin:0 0 6px'><b>How to use Management</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--text-muted)'>Six screens that read the same month from six angles. Nothing here is typed in - every number is computed from the documents the plant and the dealers are already raising, so if a figure looks wrong the answer is always in the document behind it. Click any row to open the document it came from.</p><p style='margin:10px 0 4px'><b>Do this, in order</b></p><ol style='margin:0 0 4px 18px'><li><b>Management Dashboard</b> is the daily one: revenue, spend, margin, output, quality, complaints and the wage bill on one screen. It answers <i>how are we doing</i>; the other five answer <i>why</i>.</li><li><b>Sales Analytics</b> - revenue by day, best models, top dealers and customers, and the receivable ageing. The order-to-invoice funnel shows where a sale is stuck: ordered but not delivered, or delivered but not billed.</li><li><b>Purchase Analytics</b> - spend by supplier and material, what has been ordered and not received, and what has been received and not billed.</li><li><b>Daily Production</b> - units built per day against units tested and passed, split by shift, with the foundry and winding lines underneath.</li><li><b>Dealer Network</b> - every dealer ranked, with a fault rate per dealer and the districts the pumps actually landed in. Silent dealers are the ones to ring.</li><li><b>People &amp; Payroll</b> - headcount by department, attendance for the period, and what the last payroll run cost.</li></ol><p style='margin:10px 0 4px'><b>Watch out for</b></p><ul style='margin:0 0 4px 18px'><li>Every screen defaults to the last 30 days. Change the period at the top - the whole screen, tiles and tables included, moves with it.</li><li>Money tiles are shortened to lakhs and crores so they read at a glance; hover for the exact rupee figure.</li><li>A dealer login never sees this workspace. Dealers get <b>My Business</b>, which shows only their own network.</li></ul></div>\", \"col\": 12}}]",
